# Wave 15: fix cmap forces in an energy minimization (docs.lammps.org/fix_cmap.html: "The forces due to this
# fix are imposed during an energy minimization,"), with fix_modify cmap energy yes so the CMAP energy is part
# of the minimized quantity (the same 8-atom chain and grids as w15cmap_run). Zero iterations: the setup
# force and energy evaluation of the minimizer (a line search would also depend on the minimizer's own steps).
# oracle-inputs: w15cmap_grid.txt w15cmap_chain.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        f f f
fix             cmap all cmap w15cmap_grid.txt
fix_modify      cmap energy yes
read_data       w15cmap_chain.data fix cmap crossterm CMAP
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
dihedral_style  harmonic
pair_style      zero 10.0
pair_coeff      * *
bond_coeff      1 300.0 1.53
angle_coeff     1 60.0 111.0
dihedral_coeff  1 2.0 1 3
thermo_style    custom step pe ebond eangle edihed f_cmap
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
min_style       cg
minimize        1.0e-10 1.0e-10 0 0
